   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Carlos. Your identity is verified.\n\nI looked at two recent orders from Taqueria Luz:\n\n- **Order 7388** (Oct 17): This one has carne asada tacos and elote, with no agua fresca. It was delivered Oct 17, more than 48 hours ago, so I can't compensate for a missing item on it.\n- **Order Q-7401** (today, Oct 24): This one has carne asada tacos, elote, and agua fresca. The courier handed it off at 7:01 PM, and the delivery was on time. Since your description (tacos and agua fresca, no elote) matches this order, I assume this is the one you mean.\n\nFor the missing elote on Q-7401, you can choose one of two options:\n\n1. **Refund of $5.50** to your Visa ending 4242.\n2. **Account credit of $6.60** (the elote's price plus 20%), usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
